   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"55925c82-4367-7948-82cf-918e7a2c385e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
8. Experimental program C: multiscale microscopy or spectroscopy\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"057c8eb5-fb6d-a149-b69b-bf43569ef7d2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.1. Core idea", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"27f8cd76-c0ff-ea48-b876-ce13bec74b75"],

Cell["\<\
Standard intuition says finer resolution should always reveal more truth. \
RHUFT predicts instead that some observables may stabilize only in particular \
resolution windows. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ee124c50-bef7-c144-abfa-3fe4fec56ffb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.2. Approach", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"103879a9-af04-3243-a77f-e62079d2382c"],

Cell["Use controlled multiresolution measurement and record: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33c83db2-8aa6-614d-8a56-6d08065e6e60"],

Cell["which features persist,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8d1ff78f-0d99-9644-b120-0329bfaa26b2"],

Cell["which features fragment,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"172deaf5-bfcf-cb40-8918-51cd1c76a377"],

Cell["which features appear only in specific scale bands,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"5b82249f-b1ad-b64e-a948-f75433fa32a0"],

Cell["\<\
whether feature persistence correlates with coherence proxies or geometry of \
interrogation.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c64e3671-abc5-3041-8ef3-0a5f8c6d78b0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.3. Why this is profound", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"3e5ecf1e-2a43-d542-abba-40411348aa82"],

Cell["\<\
This would move science from \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]maximum resolution\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] thinking to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]correct \
stabilization band\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] thinking. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"954fea12-5c6f-0e4b-87b0-9ab53e843393"],

