  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d2d245d2-0475-c547-88e3-a3084a407cd1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14. An explicit path to approachable breakthroughs", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"bfea0ac3-6101-2a41-aa24-78f22b6126df"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14.1. Breakthrough class 1: better sensor arrays", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"631bf33e-1470-734a-9367-f8ab92e4f37c"],

Cell["\<\
Use golden-angle or irrational-spacing arrays to reduce aliasing and mode \
degeneracy.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"763dc5ab-44bc-324e-9b3c-f0cdc5be75e6"],

Cell["This is directly buildable. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"520a576a-1768-4c43-be97-99a4aafda58f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14.2. Breakthrough class 2: geometry-aware calibration", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"66ea9f81-45ff-bb43-9f0f-fd8416f08f69"],

Cell["\<\
Fit instruments using recurrence and geometry proxies, not just scalar \
transfer functions.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4e64d03f-86dd-be4e-a06d-b964c333dbe4"],

Cell["This is software-accessible. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c57cef10-5db0-2e4c-9f8e-0d5d321831fb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14.3. Breakthrough class 3: stabilization-path reporting", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"293b929e-e550-954f-9f7a-9d148aaa256b"],

Cell["\<\
Log and analyze transient dynamics, hysteresis, and phase settling instead of \
only final readings.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6801b45d-a84c-f64c-8420-9e2435a12497"],

Cell["This is often possible with current instruments. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9198028e-f8e9-1b47-9642-62e192b6183c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14.4. Breakthrough class 4: multiscale observability maps", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5f7af5a1-1194-3247-ae01-4f40cf1ee47d"],

Cell["\<\
Create resolution-window maps to determine where features stabilize most \
reproducibly.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9017dcd9-78bf-7e4e-bd89-cd84b99a4d95"],

Cell["This is experimentally powerful and realistic. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"88ce7e69-a450-7d42-8c65-8f5870a3acc2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
14.5. Breakthrough class 5: closure-sensitive resonator engineering\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"78bee8fb-4816-e14a-9752-753a037148cb"],

Cell["\<\
Design resonators whose topology and recurrence structure are varied \
systematically, then compare standard and enriched models.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"48d936a8-6e9f-4d44-86b4-5d43b1fd3dd6"],

Cell["This is difficult but feasible. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e0cc98f5-bc42-0a45-be15-2cc6fd30734a"],

